            <div class="content-block">
                <p>Royce Thompson continue to lead the way with our range of Photo Electric Controls</p>
                <p>Royce Thompson has been at the forefront of the photo-electric street lighting and amenity controls market since <span data-field="start_year">{{ start_year }}</span>.</p>
                <p>With our extensive experience, Royce Thompson has given street and amenity lighting engineers the confidence to choose the right product and forget products that they know and trust. After all, they want to know they have products that will ensure years of exceptional performance on key transport, infrastructure and amenity lighting projects nationwide.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 48%;">
            <div class="content-block">
                <p>Today's street lighting engineers agree that a photo-electronic control located many metres in the air on street or amenity architecture must be reliable and highly accurate. We provide the high quality products that will ensure years of exceptional performance on key transport, infrastructure and amenity lighting projects nationwide.</p>
                <p>Royce Thompson products are designed to be reliable and robust. We offer a wide range of solutions to meet the specific needs of your project, from simple on/off controls to complex dimming and monitoring solutions. We provide the quality and service you can trust.</p>
